WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:07.916
Beauty stared at Beast. "You're the prince!"

2
00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:10.503
Beast opened his eyes.

3
00:00:10.504 --> 00:00:15.728
He tried to speak, but no words came out.

4
00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:20.956
"I'm sorry about the princess," Beauty said.

5
00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:24.798
"But I still don't understand.

6
00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:28.347
How did you become a beast?"

7
00:00:28.348 --> 00:00:30.542
Chirp! Chirp!

8
00:00:30.543 --> 00:00:33.978
The birds were trying to explain.

9
00:00:33.979 --> 00:00:37.111
Beauty groaned.

10
00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:42.446
"I can't understand what you're saying."

11
00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:45.920
Deer hurried over to the rose.

12
00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:49.463
She tapped the glass with her nose.

13
00:00:49.464 --> 00:00:54.783
"The rose has something to do with it?" Beauty asked.

14
00:00:54.784 --> 00:00:57.475
The birds nodded.

15
00:00:57.476 --> 00:01:00.784
Beauty thought for a moment.

16
00:01:00.785 --> 00:01:05.079
"That's why Beast got angry when I touched it!

17
00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.422
The rose holds a curse, doesn't it?"

18
00:01:09.423 --> 00:01:13.444
Beauty suddenly understood everything.

19
00:01:13.445 --> 00:01:17.244
"So, when the last petal falls . . ."

20
00:01:17.245 --> 00:01:20.742
Beauty couldn't finish saying it.

21
00:01:20.743 --> 00:01:25.747
"Deer, you and the birds are cursed too?"

22
00:01:25.748 --> 00:01:29.114
Deer nodded sadly.

23
00:01:29.115 --> 00:01:31.887
The birds tweeted loudly.

24
00:01:31.888 --> 00:01:36.293
"What a horrible curse!" Beauty cried.

25
00:01:36.294 --> 00:01:38.509
"How do we break it?"

26
00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.872
Deer looked from Beauty to Beast.

27
00:01:41.873 --> 00:01:44.926
Beauty gently shook Beast.

28
00:01:44.927 --> 00:01:50.187
"Please tell me how to break the curse!" Beauty begged.

29
00:01:50.188 --> 00:01:55.189
"I . . . I can't," Beast said.

30
00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.803
"You must!" Beauty said.

31
00:01:58.804 --> 00:02:03.032
"There are only two petals left on the rose."

32
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:06.754
Beast groaned and shook his head.

33
00:02:06.755 --> 00:02:11.390
Suddenly the air outside filled with a terrible sound.

34
00:02:11.391 --> 00:02:14.393
Crack! Crash!

35
00:02:14.394 --> 00:02:19.143
"The woodcutters are getting closer!" Beauty said.

36
00:02:19.144 --> 00:02:25.572
Beast stared at her. "Could you ever love me?"

37
00:02:25.573 --> 00:02:30.352
"Why do you keep asking me that?" Beauty said.

38
00:02:30.353 --> 00:02:33.191
"We're in danger, Beast!

39
00:02:33.192 --> 00:02:36.352
You have to defend your castle!"

40
00:02:36.353 --> 00:02:42.122
"I'm sorry," he said. "I can't."

41
00:02:42.123 --> 00:02:45.848
Just then Deer stomped her hooves.

42
00:02:45.849 --> 00:02:48.902
Her eyes looked fierce.

43
00:02:48.903 --> 00:02:52.016
"You're right!" Beauty said.

44
00:02:52.017 --> 00:02:56.500
"If Beast won't defend the castle, then we will!

45
00:02:56.501 --> 00:02:58.953
Let's go!"

